        "title": "在 Mac 上将屏幕截图到剪贴板而不是文件",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/capture-screen-into-clipboard-instead-of-file-on-mac/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，我发现我更想直接将截取的图像粘贴到编辑器中，而不是将图像保存到文件。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "capture-screen-into-clipboard-instead-of-file-on-mac",
